            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Orijinal değişkene güncellenmiş değeri yeniden ata.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"yearly = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Discount increased to 2%&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"yearly = yearly.replace(\" /><text value=\"&quot;2%&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\"&quot;4%&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(yearly)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"43\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Discount increased to 4%\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>yearly</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
